{"id":"73b72c6204e34088","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-recursion2-ce-set.md","title":"ZFC Recursion2 Ce Set","display":"df-zfc-recursion2-ce-set — ZFC Recursion2 Ce Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursion2-ce-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursion2-ce-set"],"display":"df-zfc-recursion2-ce-set — ZFC Recursion2 Ce Set","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursion2-ce-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursion2-ce-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursion2-ce-set — ZFC Recursion2 Ce Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"278f83d281480a6e\" href=\"?note=278f83d281480a6e\" title=\"58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map\">58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> (set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> (partial computable function graph)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2PartialComputableMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2PartialComputableMap}_S\\)</span> (partial-computable-map predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"278f83d281480a6e\" href=\"?note=278f83d281480a6e\" title=\"58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map\">58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2CeSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2CeSet}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}ce\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2CeSet}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\exists f\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2PartialComputableMap}_S(f)\\land A=\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}ce\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2CeSet}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\exists f\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2PartialComputableMap}_S(f)\\land A=\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The definition quantifies over the set-coded graph recognized by the upstream predicate; it does not treat the metalinguistic notation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e\">\\(\\varphi_e\\)</span> as though it were automatically an object-language function graph.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map","status":"resolved","id":"278f83d281480a6e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map","status":"resolved","id":"278f83d281480a6e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","locat